OL,3,AEnergy bills will soar - here's how you
OL,4,Acan ease the pain
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy prices are forecast to rise by
OL,7,F26% for millions of homes in January,
OL,8,Fbut experts say there are ways to keep
OL,9,Fa check on rising bills.
OL,11,FHere are four areas to consider ahead
OL,12,Fof the increase.
OL,14,FEnergy regulator Ofgem's price cap, as
OL,15,Fwell as suppliers' fixed deals, set a
OL,16,Flimit on the price of each unit of
OL,17,Fenergy, not the total bill.
OL,19,FSo, you pay for what you use. Millions
OL,20,Fof people have cut back on their energy
OL,21,Fconsumption during years of relatively
OL,22,Fhigh prices.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
